ing; Palma 2021). CONTENT-ONLY, Book suppressed, no waiver even for this ultra-luxury island. Re-verify each publish cycle. Parent: quirimbas-archipelago-mozambique."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-30","hits":5,"misses":17,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; EVERY hit is HELD behind the L4 booking hold - one-resort private island; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"held"},{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"held"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Anantara Medjumbe Private Island (HELD)","why_ultra":"a 12-villa private-island honeymoon over 400m reef drop-offs - the barefoot-ultra of the Quirimbas; documented for the day the hold lifts, sold by no one today","earning":"none while held","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"n/a (L4 booking hold)","tier":"ultra","status":"HELD"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-30","hero":{"query":"Medjumbe Island, Mozambique"},"geo":{"lat":-11.8163,"lng":40.6039}}'::jsonb, 38),
